    {
      "id": "PR_kwDOFpg0Ns7PXmIF",
      "title": "Add wREAL8 (Wrapped REAL8) token for Base and Optimism",
      "author": "rafael-minuesa",
      "number": 1298,
      "body": "## Summary\n\nAdding **wREAL8 (Wrapped REAL8)** to the Superchain token list for Base and Optimism.\n\nwREAL8 is the wrapped version of REAL8, a Stellar-native token, bridged 1:1 via the [REAL8 bridge](https://app.real8.org). It has active liquidity pools on both chains:\n\n- **Base** — Uniswap V4 wREAL8/USDC pool\n- **Optimism** — Uniswap V3 wREAL8/USDC pool\n\n### Contract addresses\n\n| Chain | Address | Explorer |\n|-------|---------|----------|\n| Base | `0x9f1605a496FD56A728bbd088Cf2Ecade4d40129c` | [BaseScan](https://basescan.org/token/0x9f1605a496FD56A728bbd088Cf2Ecade4d40129c) |\n| Optimism | `0x34445f2cbA3964b5E814dB419F2beF12420A4C49` | [Optimistic Etherscan](https://optimistic.etherscan.io/token/0x34445f2cbA3964b5E814dB419F2beF12420A4C49) |\n\n### Token details\n- **Name:** Wrapped REAL8\n- **Symbol:** wREAL8\n- **Decimals:** 7\n- **Website:** https://real8.org",
      "repository": "ethereum-optimism/ethereum-optimism.github.io",
      "createdAt": "2026-04-01T20:13:14Z",
      "mergedAt": null,
      "additions": 15,
      "deletions": 0
